---- MODULE CounterAction ----
EXTENDS Naturals

VARIABLE x

Init == x = 0

Inc == x' = x + 1
Jump == x = 0 /\ x' = 3

Next == Inc \/ Jump

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_x

Small == x < 5

NoJump == ~(x = 0 /\ x' = 3)

NotThree == x # 3

NotFour == x # 4
====


