--- file: scripts/test/corpus/CounterRules/CounterRules.cfg ---
SPECIFICATION Spec
INVARIANTS
  NotTwo
  NotThree
  AtMostTwo
CONSTRAINT Small


--- file: scripts/test/corpus/CounterRules/CounterRules.tla ---
---- MODULE CounterRules ----
EXTENDS Naturals

VARIABLE x

M == INSTANCE Moves

Init == x = 0

Step == x' = x + 1
Jump == M!Jump(x, x')

Next == Step \/ Jump

Spec == Init /\ [][Next]_x

Small == x < 2

NotTwo == x # 2

NotThree == x # 3

AtMostTwo == x <= 2
====


--- file: scripts/test/corpus/CounterRules/Moves.tla ---
---- MODULE Moves ----
EXTENDS Naturals

Jump(a, b) == b = a + 3
====


